  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drive-detail/PowerProfileChart.tsx). The remainder back the
  native state envelope (freshness chip, connectivity banner, loading / empty / error
  chrome) and the accessibility summary scaffolding.
*/

